ml-platform
  entry     acme:bindings.toml:45
  store     acme
  checkout  /Volumes/work/acme/ml/ml-platform

Scope
  acme-ml  ← machine.toml [roots] acme-ml ([HOME]/.config/kipi/machine.toml:8)
  chain: acme → acme-ml

Skills  ○ inherited  ● explicit  ✗ excluded
  ○ code-review            ← scopes.acme.skills (acme:bindings.toml:13)
  ○ pr-conventions         ← scopes.acme.skills (acme:bindings.toml:13)
  ○ personal/commit-style  ← scopes.acme.skills (acme:bindings.toml:13)
  ○ dbt-conventions        ← scopes.acme-ml.skills (acme:bindings.toml:20)

Always-on
  conventions/acme.md  ← scopes.acme.always (acme:bindings.toml:13)
  registry of acme     ← scopes.acme.registry (acme:bindings.toml:13)
  this-repo section    ← built in

Registry
  acme  ← scopes.acme.registry (acme:bindings.toml:13)
  6 repos in scopes acme, acme-ml

Related
  (none)

Grant: related  ← defaults.grant (acme:bindings.toml:8)
  ~/stores/acme-store/repos       store acme repos/       ← grant: store `acme` dirs
  ~/stores/acme-store/skills      store acme skills/      ← grant: store `acme` dirs
  ~/stores/personal-store/skills  store personal skills/  ← scopes.acme.skills (acme:bindings.toml:13)

Settings  (repo > scope chain > defaults > built-in)
  agents         claude, generic  ← defaults.agents (acme:bindings.toml:8)
  budget_tokens  4000             ← defaults.budget_tokens (acme:bindings.toml:8)
  grant          related          ← defaults.grant (acme:bindings.toml:8)
